3	Hello Wyrld	3	2023-01-28 23:50:35.234045+00	53723037	<div>In a wyrld of floating islands, mechanical skyships and ancient magical mysteries, heroic adventurers take to the skies as the Iman Empire and Hygar Republic teeter on the brink of war. \n\n<u>Curent Missions</u>\n1. <b>Plot against the Hanseltons.</b> Somebody attempted to blow up the meeting between Hanseltons and Suls\n2. <b>The Phantom Flayer. </b>Svax the Mind Flayer has been trapped in the ethereal Plane and seeks his vengeance by haunting the party. He's sure to return eventually and will only strike when his prey is vulnerable\n3. <b>Visiting the Collage</b>. Seek answers to personal magical mysteries as the Mages College, Talon's point.\n\n<u>Our Heros:\n</u>Vandolain (vandolina) - Tiefling Rogue \nKhazier - Elf Monk\nAyla - Elf Druid\nSteffi - Harengon Bard\nBrock Blackstar - Dwarf Sorcerer\nLex Lionheart - lionen warlock\nVoxre Rarc - Tuscan Barbarian\nTherefin Olara - Half Elf Paladin\nSans Sherrif - Saurian Trailblazer</div>
